#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/gke.rst:9
msgid ""
"Provisions a new Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE) Cluster in target Google "
"Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Aprovisiona un nuevo Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE) Clúster en destino "
